<body>

<h1 class="main-title">Staff Payroll Demonstration</h1>

<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Title:</span> Staff Payroll System using Inheritance and Runtime Polymorphism</div>

<div class="meta-field">
  <span class="meta-label">Objective/Aim:</span><br>
  To design and implement a Java program to calculate and display the salary structure of permanent and temporary staff using inheritance, constructors, method overriding, and dynamic method dispatch.
</div>

<h2 class="section-header">System Requirements :</h2>
<div class="sub-heading">Hardware</div>
<ul>
  <li>Standard PC/Laptop</li><li>Intel Core i3/i5 processor or equivalent</li>
  <li>Minimum 4 GB RAM</li><li>Minimum 500 MB free storage</li><li>Keyboard and Monitor</li>
</ul>

<div class="sub-heading">Software</div>
<ul>
  <li>Operating System: Windows/Linux/macOS</li>
  <li>Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or JDK 21)</li>
  <li>Text Editor or IDE such as Eclipse, IntelliJ IDEA, NetBeans, or VS Code</li>
  <li>Command Prompt/Terminal</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-header">Algorithm / Logic Description:</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Create a superclass named <code>Staff</code> with attribute <code>staffId</code>.</li>
  <li>Define a constructor to initialize <code>staffId</code> and a base method <code>calculateSalary()</code>.</li>
  <li>Create a derived class <code>PermanentStaff</code> extending <code>Staff</code>.</li>
  <li>Override <code>calculateSalary()</code> in <code>PermanentStaff</code> to calculate gross salary with basic (28000), allowance (12000), and travel allowance (4000).</li>
  <li>Create a derived class <code>TemporaryStaff</code> extending <code>Staff</code>.</li>
  <li>Override <code>calculateSalary()</code> in <code>TemporaryStaff</code> to calculate gross salary with basic (15000), allowance (2000), and travel allowance (2500).</li>
  <li>Create the <code>StaffPayroll</code> class containing the <code>main()</code> method.</li>
  <li>Initialize a staff identifier (e.g., <code>"P101"</code>).</li>
  <li>Use conditional statements (<code>startsWith("P")</code> or <code>startsWith("T")</code>) to instantiate the appropriate subclass through a superclass reference variable (<code>Staff worker</code>).</li>
  <li>Invoke <code>calculateSalary()</code> through the reference to demonstrate runtime polymorphism.</li>
  <li>Stop the program.</li>
</ol>

<div class="page-break"></div>

