<h2 class="section-header">Result:</h2>
<p>The Staff Payroll program was successfully implemented in Java using object-oriented principles. The program demonstrates inheritance with <code>super()</code> constructor invocation, method overriding for distinct salary structures, and dynamic method dispatch to evaluate salaries based on employee categories.</p>

